                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَا</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Alvum dejecit;</i> (Msb, TA;) <i>ventumve
per anum emisit:</i> (TA:) <i>he voided his ordure;</i>
or <i>broke wind.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَا</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَآءٌ</span>, <i>He was
quick,</i> or <i>swift,</i> and <i>outstripped.</i> (S.) See an
ex. of the inf. n., voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غولٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَا</span>
                        <i>He became
safe,</i> or <i>secure; he escaped.</i> (Msb, &amp;c.)

